            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakalua, wakambila bantu mei onso a musambu eu mu matshu abo, yeye ne Hoshea, muana mulume wa Nuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakashikisha kuambila Bena Isalele bonso mdi â onso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yeye wakabambila kabidi ne, Tekai mei onso anakunuambila lelu mu mitshima yenu, mei onso a mikenji mene mudi nuambila bana benu bua bobo kuyenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebu kambualu bua hatuhu kunudi; kadi budi muoyo wenu, budi buvudisha matuku enu mu buloba bunuyaya kuhiana dishiya dia Yadene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Mose dituku adi mene ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banda biebe mukuna eu wa Abalima, ku mutu kua mukuna wa Nebo, udi buludiludi ne Yeleko mu buloba bua Moaba, utangile buloba bua Kanâna bundi mpa Bena Isalele bu buhianyi buabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afue biebe ku mukuna ûdi ubanda, usangishibue kudi bankambua bebe, bu muakafua Alona, mukulu webe, ku mukuna wa Hô, wakasangishibua kudi bankambua bandi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua wewe wakahidia dî dianyi munkatshi mua Bena Isalele ku mai a Meliba a mu Kadesha mu tshihela tshia Sina; bualu bua wewe kuakanjidila munkatshi mua Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua wewe neutangile buloba budi ku mpala kuebe; kadi kuena ubuela mu buloba bundi mpa Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
